      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COOL MIST (1) is racing well without winning, recording four minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when second (17.32) over 300m at this track. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Top chance in this line up. SIENNA LILLY (6) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Iron River (17.57) in a Maiden. Has good speed so she should be prominent despite the draw. Can measure up. BUNDOCK MR. BEEF (2) jumped from the squeeze on debut and finished midfield at this track over 411m (24.51). Much improved and rates a winning chance. ROBELL RUMI (8) will make her presence felt following a brief layoff.",
